# The desk photograph's master. tools/shoot-desk.mjs writes it at DPR 2 and
# tools/webp-desk.py derives shots/desk.webp, which is the only one the page
# loads. Keeping a 1 MB PNG in history for a fallback no browser has needed
# since 2020 is not worth it — re-run the two scripts instead.
shots/desk.png
